    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        827,
        1497,
        901
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York has a strong commitment to equal opportunity for all employees; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2615,
          "min": -1.2517
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0004
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.0072,
          "min": -0.1429
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9808,
        "area_px": 96375,
        "density": 0.10177,
        "chars": 97,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.89
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        942,
        1497,
        1053
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, pursuant to section 813(a)(12) of the Charter, the City has adopted and implemented an Affirmative Employment Plan setting forth policies and procedures for the prevention and remediation of unlawful employment discrimination; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2021,
          "min": -1.1384
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.0892
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 24107,
        "area_px": 143920,
        "density": 0.1675,
        "chars": 239,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.91
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1095,
        1497,
        1243
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, sexual harassment is a form of unlawful discrimination that affects both women and men; the law governing this subject is complex and still evolving; and cases of sexual harassment often include related complaints of other forms of discrimination;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2157,
          "min": -1.1978
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.009
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 24209,
        "area_px": 190180,
        "density": 0.1273,
        "chars": 256,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.57
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1286,
        1497,
        1439
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on October 28, 1992 the Mayor appointed a Task Force on Sexual Harassment (\"Task Force\") to study the City's procedures for preventing and addressing sexual harassment, and to make recommendation as to how such procedures could be improved; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1981,
          "min": -1.1219
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 57,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0053
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 25151,
        "area_px": 197890,
        "density": 0.1271,
        "chars": 253,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1480,
        1497,
        1588
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Task Force submitted a report to the Mayor on November 1, 1993, recommending that the City establish, on a pilot basis, a Citywide Office for Sexual Harassment Prevention; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2196,
          "min": -1.3306
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 46,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 18158,
        "area_px": 138780,
        "density": 0.13084,
        "chars": 188,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.35
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        1632,
        1497,
        1784
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, while the immediate objective of the establishment of such an office is to enhance the City's ability to address the problem of sexual harassment, the long term goal is to develop approaches, which can be tested by the new office, that will enable the City to address all forms of discrimination with heightened sensitivity;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1824,
          "min": -1.1906
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 62,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0045
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 31831,
        "area_px": 196605,
        "density": 0.1619,
        "chars": 333,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.46
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        194,
        1827,
        1497,
        1903
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of New York, it is hereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
